---
const courses = [
  "Heartsaver First Aid",
  "Heartsaver CPR/AED",
  "Friends and Family CPR",
  "BLS for the Healthcare Provider",
  "Heartsaver Bloodborne Pathogens",
  "Pediatric First Aid",
];

const locations = [
  "Reading", "Pottsville", "Allentown", "Bethlehem", "Easton",
  "Lancaster", "Lebanon", "Pottstown", "Philadelphia", "Canton",
  "Williamsport", "Danville"
];
---
<section id="first-aid-courses" class="bg-surface py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16">

      <!-- Courses -->
      <div class="reveal-left">
        <div class="mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
            [ Certification Classes ]
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-8"
            style="font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: 1.1;">
          Training Classes We Offer
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">
          KRE Security will provide the following classes — as approved by the American Heart Association and the American Red Cross — offering customized certification programs for healthcare providers and lay rescuers, including any course in the AHA and BLS Family of courses curriculum.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          {courses.map((course) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 border border-border p-3" style="background-color: var(--color-background);">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);"></span>
              <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground">{course}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="border border-border p-4" style="background-color: var(--color-background);">
          <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
            [ Also Offered ]
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-muted-foreground space-y-1">
            <li>• In-classroom instruction on basic fire extinguisher use and operation</li>
            <li>• Blood Borne Pathogens training per OSHA standard 1910.1030</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Locations + Standards -->
      <div class="reveal-right flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
              [ Service Locations ]
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4"
              style="font-size: var(--text-h3); line-height: 1.2;">
            Classes Offered In
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
            {locations.map((loc) => (
              <div class="border border-border px-3 py-2 text-center" style="background-color: var(--color-background);">
                <span class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground">{loc}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-dark-border p-5" style="background-color: var(--color-dark-background);">
          <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
            [ Teaching Standards ]
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-dark-muted-foreground);">
            Training certification and material is taught in accordance with all rules, regulations, and standards of both the American Heart Association and the American Red Cross curriculums. Our instructors conduct ongoing training and all staff meet current teaching backgrounds and security clearances.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-border p-5" style="background-color: var(--color-background);">
          <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
            [ Equipment ]
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            KRE Security provides students with the most up-to-date equipment, making our teaching experience as realistic as possible with current CPR, First Aid and AED tools.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
